[{"id":166670362,"discussion_id":"1d916a7d0e4cd519230a9682792695fc79a27fd4","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu) (2/2) | ✅ [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n hz36amy_00, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-27T22:31:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T14:58:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166670369,"discussion_id":"5fd4ae131eba986b6f7812586a3c1e4b320990cd","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-27T22:31:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-27T22:31:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166670401,"discussion_id":"c4b69589182fc46915eb5af05167215a7ed76595","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复FlashAttention梯度计算后处理模块中，在处理TND数据布局时，因批次索引`bIdx`可能超出有效批次范围`b`而导致的数组越界访问问题。该缺陷发生在循环迭代中计算当前序列长度`curS`时，访问全局内存数组`seqS`的非法索引，存在引发运行时错误的风险。本次修改旨在增强代码在边界条件下的安全性与稳定性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`FlashAttentionScoreGradPost`类的`NZVecClc`和`NZProcess`函数中，针对TND布局下更新`curS`的逻辑添加了边界检查。将原有的无条件计算`curS = seqS[bIdx] - seqS[bIdx - 1]`修改为条件判断：仅当`bIdx < b`时执行原计算逻辑，否则将`curS`置为0。此修改直接阻止了对`seqS`数组的越界访问，从根本上消除了潜在的运行时内存错误。","created_at":"2026-03-27T22:32:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-27T22:32:22+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166688209,"discussion_id":"6dd81da8d1da98b52cfab9c577e0ae93270d1a36","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-28T10:17:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T10:17:52+08:00","user":{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","object_id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166688507,"discussion_id":"1da39779cd195bf007470bf70c068d6edbd922a2","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=c064d85e9ddb4fdaad347ffe18f7e86d&p